{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39407","headline":"拟塞外征行 · 王贞白","name":"拟塞外征行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寇骑满鸡田，都护欲临边。\n青泥方绝漠，怀剑始辞燕。\n旌旗挂龙虎，壮士募鹰鸇。\n长城威十万，高岭奋三千。\n行行向马邑，去去指祁连。\n鼓声遥赤塞，兵气远冲天。\n对阵云初上，临城月始悬。\n风惊烽易灭，沙暗马难前。\n恩重恒思报，劳心屡损年。\n微功一可立，身轻不自怜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}